  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 307.07 Consistency Required with Shoreland Water Quality Protection Act",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 307.07 Consistency Required with Shoreland Water Quality Protection Act. All development activities associated with any project shall be conducted in compliance with applicable requirements of RSA 483-B and Env-Wq 1400 during and after construction.\n\nSource. #12803, eff 12-15-19",
